featured("commute-intl-01",1,"That could be useful. A lot of the journals are online now, so the shelves aren't as full as they used to be.","可能很實用。許多期刊現在上網了，書架不像以前那麼滿。","aren't as full as... 作比較；以 could 保留評估空間。");
